                <controls:SettingsCard
                    Description="{loc:Tr Text=&quot;Every screenshot Windows saves — Snipping Tool's (Win+Shift+S, PrtScn) and Win+PrtScn's — shows up in your history the moment the file is written, and the panel gets a Snipping tab with them and everything Snipping Tool copied. BetterClipboard only reads your Screenshots folder. Pause capturing, Ignored apps (add SnippingTool or Win+PrtScn to skip them) and the size limit apply.&quot;}"
