                -->
                <controls:SettingsCard
                    Description="{loc:Tr Text=&quot;Keeps the text of Notepad++'s unsaved “new” tabs in your history, read from Notepad++'s own backup files once a tab has rested for a minute. A small change updates the tab's entry where it is; once more than a fifth of its text is gone, the old version stays as its own entry. Notepad++'s files are never changed.&quot;}"
