                <controls:SettingsCard
                    Description="{loc:Tr Text='Records the full path of every file you open in Notepad++, as if you had copied it; opening it again moves it to the top. BetterClipboard asks a running Notepad++ which files it has open; the files it restores from its last session do not count.'}"
