                <controls:SettingsCard
                    Description="{loc:Tr Text='While voidtools Everything is installed or running, the panel gets an Everything tab: the files and folders you open from Everything, newest first, next to everything copied from it. BetterClipboard only reads from Everything. A file is kept in your history only when you paste, copy or pin it there.'}"
